# Clerk's publishable key for the "Hive" application (pk_test_... for the
# development instance, pk_live_... for production on hivefleet.dev). Baked
# into the static export at build time; it is public by design. Without it the
# site still builds and its sign-in button says the sign-in is not set up yet.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# Where "Open your console" sends a signed-in member: the team front
# (ADR-070). Empty until the front exists; the button then explains.
NEXT_PUBLIC_HIVE_CONSOLE_URL=
